-- Rutina base de 3 días (referencia). El plan por usuario se crea
-- desde la app; este bloque documenta la prescripción canónica.
-- Día A: Día A — Empuje, Handstand y Pecho (weekday 1)
--   [Bloque de handstand]
--     handstand-libre: 10 x 5-15s, rest 40s
--     handstand-pared: 3 x 20-40s, rest 75s
--   [Fuerza e hipertrofia]
--     smith-shoulder-press: 4 x 6-8 reps, rest 120s
--     dips: 4 x 5-10 reps, rest 120s
--     incline-db-press: 3 x 8-12 reps, rest 90s
--     lateral-raises: 3 x 12-20 reps, rest 60s
--     pec-deck: 3 x 10-15 reps, rest 75s
--     triceps-pushdown: 3 x 10-15 reps, rest 60s
--   [Core]
--     hollow-body-hold: 3 x 20-40s, rest 60s
-- Día B: Día B — Espalda, Bíceps y Core (weekday 3)
--   [Handstand técnico ligero]
--     handstand-tecnico: 6 x 5-15s, rest 45s
--   [Fuerza e hipertrofia]
--     pull-ups: 5 x 2-5 reps, rest 150s
--     lat-pulldown: 3 x 8-12 reps, rest 90s
--     seated-cable-row: 4 x 8-12 reps, rest 90s
--     chest-supported-row: 3 x 10-12 reps, rest 90s
--     face-pulls: 3 x 12-20 reps, rest 60s
--     hammer-curl: 3 x 8-12 reps, rest 60s
--   [Core]
--     hanging-knee-raises: 3 x 8-15 reps, rest 60s
-- Día C: Día C — Handstand, Hombros y Tren Superior (weekday 5)
--   [Bloque de handstand]
--     handstand-libre: 10 x 3-12s, rest 45s
--     pike-pushups: 4 x 6-10 reps, rest 90s
--     wall-shoulder-taps: 3 x 4-10 reps, rest 90s
--     handstand-scapular-shrugs: 3 x 8-15 reps, rest 60s
--   [Hombros y tren superior]
--     db-shoulder-press: 3 x 8-12 reps, rest 90s
--     machine-row: 3 x 10-15 reps, rest 90s
--     machine-chest-press: 3 x 8-12 reps, rest 90s
--     lateral-raises: 3 x 15-20 reps, rest 60s
--     farmer-carry: 3 x 30-45s, rest 75s
